@guide A_31_Badlands
@name Badlands (40-41)
@faction Alliance
@levels 40-41
@zone Badlands
@chapter Azeroth
@desc Badlands, visit 1 of 1 on the Alliance route, levels 40-41.
@next A_32_SwampofSorrows

travel Badlands
train
note From Ironforge fly to Thelsamar and ride south through Loch Modan into the Badlands.
accept 2418 Power Stones | Rigglefuzz at the camp in the middle of the Badlands.
accept 705 Pearl Diving
accept 703 Barbecued Buzzard Wings
complete 703 Barbecued Buzzard Wings
turnin 703 Barbecued Buzzard Wings
accept 710 Study of the Elements: Rock | Lotwil Veriatus, west.
complete 710 Study of the Elements: Rock | Lesser Rock Elementals around Lotwil's camp.
turnin 710 Study of the Elements: Rock
accept 711 Study of the Elements: Rock
complete 711 Study of the Elements: Rock | Rock Elementals north-west of the camp.
turnin 711 Study of the Elements: Rock
accept 719 A Dwarf and His Tools | Prospector Ryedol, east of the middle.
accept 718 Mirages | Sigrun Ironhew, next to Ryedol.
accept 720 A Sign of Hope | The Crumpled Map on the ground north of Ryedol.
complete 705 Pearl Diving
complete 719 A Dwarf and His Tools | Ryedol's Lucky Pick drops from Shadowforge Tunnelers at Angor Fortress.
complete 718 Mirages | The Excavation Supply Crate in the north-east hills.
turnin 720 A Sign of Hope | Prospector Ryedol.
turnin 719 A Dwarf and His Tools
turnin 718 Mirages | Sigrun Ironhew.
accept 721 A Sign of Hope
accept 733 Scrounging | Scrap Metal from Dustbelcher ogres in the west.
complete 2418 Power Stones | Shadowforge Surveyors at Agmond's End and around Uldaman's entrance, north.
turnin 721 A Sign of Hope | Hammertoe Grez at the Uldaman excavation, north.
accept 722 Amulet of Secrets
complete 722 Amulet of Secrets | Hammertoe's Amulet drops from Magregan Deepshadow at the Stonesplinter camp just north of Hammertoe.
turnin 722 Amulet of Secrets
accept 723 Prospect of Faith
turnin 723 Prospect of Faith | Prospector Ryedol.
accept 724 Prospect of Faith | Turned in at Ironforge on your way to Dustwallow.
complete 733 Scrounging | Dustbelcher ogres in the west.
turnin 2418 Power Stones | Rigglefuzz.
turnin 705 Pearl Diving
turnin 733 Scrounging | Sigrun Ironhew.
accept 712 Study of the Elements: Rock [optional] | Needs level 42 to kill the Greater Rock Elementals comfortably.
complete 712 Study of the Elements: Rock [optional] | Bracers of Rock Binding from Greater Rock Elementals in the far south-west.
turnin 712 Study of the Elements: Rock [optional]
note Ride back north to Thelsamar and fly to Ironforge.
turnin 724 Prospect of Faith [zone=Ironforge] | Historian Karnik, Hall of Explorers.
accept 725 Passing Word of a Threat [zone=Ironforge]
turnin 725 Passing Word of a Threat [zone=Ironforge] | Advisor Belgrum, same hall.
accept 726 Passing Word of a Threat [zone=Ironforge]
turnin 726 Passing Word of a Threat [zone=Ironforge] | Historian Karnik.
accept 732 Tremors of the Earth
accept 706 Fiery Blaze Enchantments
complete 706 Fiery Blaze Enchantments
complete 732 Tremors of the Earth
turnin 706 Fiery Blaze Enchantments
turnin 732 Tremors of the Earth
level 41 | Swamp of Sorrows starts at 41. If you are lower, kill what is around you here (or run a dungeon) until you reach it.
